OL,3,GNEWSAEnforcement cameras switched on to
OL,4,Astop drivers
OL,5,
OL,6,FEnforcement cameras to ensure motorists
OL,7,Fstop driving on a town centre's main
OL,8,Fstreet are being switched on.
OL,10,FDrivers of private cars face receiving
OL,11,Fa #70 fine if they drive up Market Jew
OL,12,FStreet in Penzance, Cornwall, between
OL,13,Fthe hours of 11:00 and 16:00, Cornwall
OL,14,FCouncil said.
OL,16,FThe order to stop cars driving had been
OL,17,Fin place since 2022, but recent
OL,18,Fanalysis showed an average of 600 cars
OL,19,Fa day were breaching the rules, it
OL,20,Fadded.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,344,340,200,160,0,100
