OL,3,GNEWSAEnforcement cameras switched on to
OL,4,Astop drivers
OL,5,
OL,6,FSome businesses disagree with the move,
OL,7,Fwith one shop owner saying it is "not
OL,8,Fneeded" to prevent motorists from using
OL,9,Fthe street. Cornwall Council said "a
OL,10,Flarge number of people" were continuing
OL,11,F"to flout the restrictions, which
OL,12,Fcreates some real safety concerns".
